query` functions return the size. The 0.38 series did not have the `Buffer` API and is not affected.","Announcement: https://github.com/bytecodealliance/rustix/commit/8e6aaa6713d2bb64b1fdd8c472e3a32a10a76d70","Solution: Upgrade to >=1.1.6 (try `cargo update -p rustix`)"],"severity":"error"},"type":"diagnostic"}
